<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Your Verification Code</title>
  <style>
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .header { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 30px; background-color: #ffffff; }
    .otp-code { 
      font-size: 32px; 
      letter-spacing: 5px; 
      text-align: center; 
      margin: 25px 0; 
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    .footer { 
      padding: 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
      font-size: 12px; 
      color: #7f8c8d; 
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Your Verification Code</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello,</p>
      <p>Please use the following verification code to complete your registration:</p>
      
      <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
      
      <p>This code will expire in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes. If you didn't request this code, please ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© 2025 BuyerSignals. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>